  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF operation in Iraq, 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant supports UNICEF&apos;s work in Iraq following new waves of displacement from Tikrit. UNICEF had already by March 3 WASH to 24.000 people and will continue to set up mobile latrines and bath facilities for the displaced people still lacking accommodation. UNICEF will also contribute to delivering the necessary medicine and vaccines to the health facilities around the country, ensure water and sanitation in three newly established camps along with psychosocial support and education for children.</narrative>
  </description>
